    "body": "## Summary\n- require a fresh live GPS fix before route checkpoint/pickup confirmation\n- reject confirmations outside a configurable arrival radius while accounting for reported GPS accuracy\n- preserve worker-only access and current-location-only privacy model\n- add focused validator tests\n- expose `TRACKING_CHECKPOINT_ARRIVAL_RADIUS_METERS` in application/local Compose configuration and document the invariant\n\n## Why\nThe existing route flow allowed the assigned worker to advance from origin/intermediate checkpoints without proving they were actually near the current route target. This could produce incorrect ETA/phase state. The new guard closes that integrity gap without retaining additional location history.\n\n## Verification\nCI should run the existing backend/frontend/smoke workflows plus the new unit coverage. Do not merge unless all required checks pass.",
